{"id":"vod_sn_35928","vodId":"35928","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"赌博默示录","name_cn":"赌博默示录","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/983df06c5675cd8cac2a1370b380f804.jpg"},"summary":"故事从一艘黑夜中的赌船开始……男主角，伊藤开司，浑浑噩噩，一事无成，因为好心替人做了担保而背负上了数百万债务。为偿还欠款，开司接受怂恿上了一艘名为“希望之船”的渡轮，为的是参加一次神秘赌局，一旦获胜，就能将欠款一笔勾销。上到贼船后开司才发现，参与者多是如自己一般的失败青年。然后主办方便开出了赌局的规则：参与者须以标着“石头，剪刀，布”的扑克为道具，夺取对手身上的星星标志，赌局结束时，扑克牌未用完或星星少于三颗者将失去资格，而参赛初所能向主办方借贷的巨款，也成为让他们盈利或逃生的重要因素……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sYsf7NbwCD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/5nYppnj7fb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sBs1BMSXrn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ieTGGT4kd21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nkd5c3jkjG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/f7kWNR7LhJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Tk4YS3BMe91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VMjSjQtdf21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6g3SBfL92K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U4KQJ18wy21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ur5hrCXwR21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7rRKzBw5n01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GC3X1vEBKY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/a2NgqTLBEr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/